  "body": "Per https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/common-microsyntaxes.html#rules-for-parsing-dimension-values something like:\r\n```\r\n<img src=\"whatever\" width=\".5%\">\r\n```\r\nshould be a parse error at step 7.  Both Chrome and Safari allow it, though.\r\n\r\n@annevk ",
